    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000320",
    "title": "In Answer to Prayer",
    "description": "The public-domain text of In Answer to Prayer by Ian Maclaren, Theodore L. Cuyler, William Boyd Carpenter, W. J. Knox-Little, and William Quarrier, preserved across 10 original sections with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 19,
